{
  "bookId": "hero-215201",
  "id": "bond-29304",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "29304001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "啊呀呀，你回来了？今天有什么好事发生吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29304002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你怎么知道？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29304003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "关心主公，是我分内之事啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29304004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……别以为我没有看到你刚刚还在玩泥巴。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29304005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "照料蔬菜，也是为了学习更好地关心主公啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29304006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "哦？你的意思是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29304007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "幼苗稚嫩，若是不小心照看着——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29304008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "一疏忽，忘了浇水捉虫，就会蔫了叶子。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29304009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "时刻关注着，才能保证它们健康快乐地成长。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29304010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……好啊，你是把我当小菜苗照顾了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29304011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "嗯~如果你这么认为的话，也没有问题。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29304012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "我会好好陪着你，慢慢长大的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29304013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "所以，有什么小虫子惹你烦心的话，可以告诉我。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29304014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "我诸葛孔明罩着的菜苗，一定是最幸福的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29304015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
